    <h1>The Independent Maker: <em>Builder</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you would rather build a rough working version than write a long document about it, Builder is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, the modern careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that trips makers up.</p>
